 951:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @brief  Enables the Clock Security System.
 952:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   If a failure is detected on the HSE oscillator clock, this oscillator
 953:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         is automatically disabled and an interrupt is generated to inform the
 954:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         software about the failure (Clock Security System Interrupt, CSSI),
 955:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         allowing the MCU to perform rescue operations. The CSSI is linked to
 956:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         the Cortex-M7 NMI (Non-Maskable Interrupt) exception vector.
 957:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @retval None
 958:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_rcc.c ****   */
